    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31716" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ob-longus</span></b> , a, um, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>adj., rather long,
				longish; oblong</i> (not in Cic. or Cæs.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">missile telum hastili oblongo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					21, 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">figura,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					37, 12, 75, § 196</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">folia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					25, 3, 6</span></i>
			. 
			 § 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">21: scutula,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. Agr.
					10</span></i>
			.—<i>Comp.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">foramen oblongius,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr.
					21, 8 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">10, 11,
		4</span></i>.</div>
